      <slug></slug>
      <title>Streaming replication under the hood</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>PostgreSQL</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk, we&amp;#39;re going to peek under the hood of the new Streaming Replication feature.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am going to introduce the concepts of WAL receiver and sender, how they communicate over the network, how they interact with the rest of the server etc. I&amp;#39;m also going to cover advanced setups like multiple slaves, cascading slaves, and WAL archiving from a slave.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2591">Heikki Linnakangas</person>
      </persons>
